authority_chain:
  - docs/workspaces/denali/marketing-landing.mdoc # engineering SoT (LOCK §16.2)
  - design-system/denali-club/MASTER.md # brand tokens (never skill-overridden)
  - design-system/denali-club/pages/home.md # page overrides
