---

## 1. Purpose

Raise **visual quality** of Denali `/` from ~3.5/10 to **9+/10** (mobile-first, competitive landing) **without** breaking the engineering foundation (SDK `guestLanding`, hooks, multi-tenant, guards, smoke).

**This doc is the SoT for PR-4 visual work.** Full roadmap: [`marketing-landing-complete-plan.mdoc`](./marketing-landing-complete-plan.mdoc). Engineering spec: [`marketing-landing.mdoc`](./marketing-landing.mdoc).

---

## 2. Why ui-ux-pro-max (upstream)

[ui-ux-pro-max-skill](https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill) is a searchable design-intelligence skill (~67 styles, 161 palettes, landing patterns, UX guidelines). **Best use for us:**

| Do                                                                             | Don't                                                                         |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Run `--design-system` once for **layout / section / CTA / anti-pattern** ideas | Copy skill **colors** or **fonts** blindly                                    |
| Run `--domain landing` for hero + social-proof structure                       | Adopt **Immersive/Scroll-Story** (perf + a11y cost; conflicts with RSC-first) |
| Run `--domain ux` for mobile-first, touch, reduced-motion                      | Add fake stats, parallax, heavy client JS                                     |
| Run `--domain style` for **effects keywords** (scroll-snap, hover 200ms)       | Replace Calistoga / emerald brand                                             |
| Log decisions in **CP-SKILL** (§5)                                             | Change hooks, SDK, or `apps/marketing` plugin branches                        |

Local copy: `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/` (same API as upstream).

---

## 3. Hard boundaries (do not break)

### 3.1 LOCK — brand tokens (skill output **must not** override)

From [`marketing-landing.mdoc`](./marketing-landing.mdoc) §16.2 + [`MASTER.md`](../../../design-system/denali-club/MASTER.md):

| Key                  | Value                         | Notes                 |
| -------------------- | ----------------------------- | --------------------- |
| Primary              | `#059669`                     | Hero overlay base     |
| Accent / CTA         | `#D97706`                     | Buttons, final band   |
| Heading              | Calistoga                     | `--font-heading-en`   |
| Body                 | Inter / Vazirmatn             | fa/en                 |
| Parallax full-page   | **OFF**                       | Performance + a11y    |
| Fake stats / metrics | **OFF**                       | Legal + trust         |
| Stack                | Next RSC + CSS skin           | Max 1 client boundary |
| Icons                | Lucide (already in marketing) | No emoji as UI icons  |

### 3.2 Immutable engineering surface

```text
FORBIDDEN in PR-4:
  packages/workspace-sdk/** guestLanding / resolveGuestLandingFeatures
  workspace.manifest.json guestLanding blocks
  Renaming data-marketing-home-* hooks
  pluginId === "denali" (or any workspace literal) in apps/marketing
  data-marketing-catalog-card on home latest row
  urban / guest-club full-block CSS (P16)
```

### 3.3 Allowed change surface (PR-4 only)

```text
packages/workspaces/denali/theme/denali-marketing.css
apps/marketing/src/home/*.tsx          # presentation only — same hooks
apps/marketing/public/home/hero.webp   # ≤200KB, ≤1920w
apps/marketing/public/home/hero-og.webp  # optional 1200×630
design-system/denali-club/pages/home.md # visual overrides (not engineering)
```

