## 6. Visual target rubric (PR-4 done = 9/10)

| Score | Visual criteria                                                     |
| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 3/10  | Current — flat gradient, text-only cards, no hero.webp              |
| 6/10  | hero.webp + scrim + Calistoga scale; cards with cover images        |
| 8/10  | + trust block designed; no desktop scrollbar; polish hover/focus    |
| 9/10  | + Lighthouse LCP ≤2.5s mobile; competitive vs outdoor tour landings |
| 10/10 | + Lighthouse CI on `/` + tenant hero override plan (post-MVP)       |

**10/10 visual does not require SDK changes.**

