## 7. PR-4 implementation checklist

### 7.1 Assets (P0)

| Asset      | Path                                      | Spec                               | Done     |
| ---------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------- |
| Hero photo | `apps/marketing/public/home/hero.webp`    | ≤1920w · ≤200KB · mountain/outdoor | ✅ 177KB |
| OG crop    | `apps/marketing/public/home/hero-og.webp` | 1200×630                           | ✅ 94KB  |

Fallback remains CSS gradient if file missing (§9 assets in engineering spec).

### 7.2 Hero (`denali-marketing.css`)

```text
[x] background-image: url("/home/hero.webp") + gradient scrim ≥4.5:1 white text
[x] min-height min(70vh, 32rem) mobile · min(80vh, 40rem) ≥1024px
[x] H1 --mkt-text-display → 2.5rem at ≥1024px (home.md)
[x] CTA full-width mobile · min-height 2.75rem · box-shadow + focus-visible
[x] Subtle bottom fade into page bg (not hard edge)
```

### 7.3 Latest cards

```text
[x] Cover image dominant (CatalogCoverImage) — min-height on figure
[x] hide scrollbar mobile · scroll-snap mobile · 2-col ≥640px · 3-col ≥1024px
[x] card hover: --mkt-shadow-card-hover · translateY var(--mkt-lift-md)
[x] price/meta typography hierarchy
[x] empty catalog → section hidden (HOME-UNIT-03)
[x] section overlaps hero fade (margin-block-start negative)
```

### 7.4 Trust

```text
[x] Logo max-height 3rem · tagline readable · Mountain icon decorative
[x] Section feels like "band" not leftover footer line
[x] No invented numbers
```

### 7.5 Final CTA

```text
[x] Full-bleed accent band · white/inverted CTA button
[x] Repeat hero primary label (uses home.full.hero.ctaPrimary)
```

### 7.6 Shell (optional polish)

```text
[x] header sticky + glass blur + subtle shadow (CSS only, no JS)
[x] brand logo + displayName rhythm (data-marketing-brand-title)
[x] nav touch targets ≥2.75rem · focus-visible rings
```

