## 9. Anti-patterns (skill + web landing best practice)

| Anti-pattern                           | Why blocked                        |
| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Skill default navy/gold palette        | Breaks Denali emerald brand        |
| Outfit / Work Sans from skill output   | Breaks Calistoga + Inter/Vazirmatn |
| Full-page parallax / scroll-jacking    | LCP, a11y, RSC-first               |
| Fake “500+ climbers” stats             | Spec §1.2 non-goals                |
| Carousel auto-play                     | Motion + mobile UX                 |
| Desktop horizontal scrollbar on latest | SMK-MKT-HOME-02 fail               |
| `data-marketing-catalog-card` on home  | guard-home-hooks                   |
| Changing urban minimal home            | SMK-MKT-HOME-05                    |

