## PR-9 Visual Excellence (2026-07-04) — closed

**Goal:** Raise perceived visual quality from ~6/10 → **8.5+/10** without SDK/manifest/hook changes.

### Scope (allowed)

| Layer             | Files                                                        |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |
| CSS               | `packages/workspaces/denali/theme/denali-marketing.css`      |
| Home presentation | `apps/marketing/src/home/*.tsx` (hooks frozen)               |
| Assets            | `apps/marketing/public/home/**`                              |
| i18n              | `home.full.hero.ctaSecondary` fa/en                          |
| Cover fallback    | `resolve-home-tour-cover-url.ts`, `home-marketing-assets.ts` |

### P0 — Data fallbacks

- `resolveHomeTourCoverUrl` → `/home/fallback-tour-cover.webp` when catalog lacks photos or URL host is IANA `.example` smoke placeholder (`cdn.example`)
- `deriveHomeGalleryPhotos` appends 3 static gallery images when &lt;3 tour covers
- Destination cards use `/home/destinations/{id}.webp`

### P1 — Hero Renaissance (CSS-only)

- Ken Burns on `::before` pseudo (`mkt-hero-ken-burns`, 22s)
- Glass search form (`backdrop-filter` + fallback)
- Dual CTA: primary + ghost `#why-us` (manifest `guestLanding.whySectionAnchor`)
- Staggered `mkt-hero-enter` on content children
- Scroll hint chevron (hidden under `prefers-reduced-motion`)

### P2 — Typography

- `:lang(fa)` → Vazirmatn headings, larger display
- `:lang(en)` → Calistoga headings

### P4 — Section depth

- Destination photo cards with hover zoom
- Why bento: first tile spans 2 cols @640px
- Journey horizontal grid + connector @1024px
- Testimonials decorative quote + gradient card
- Final CTA radial/mesh gradient band

### P5 — Performance

- `CatalogCoverImage.priority` only when `featured` primary card
- Ken Burns + scroll hint disabled under reduced motion

### P6 — Closure extras (2026-07-04)

- Distinct cropped assets (ImageMagick) for destinations/gallery/fallback
- CSS `animation-timeline: view()` scroll reveal on all post-hero sections
- Equipment checklist grid cards with SVG checkmarks
- Featured bento asymmetric @1024px (primary spans 2 rows)
- `overflow-x: clip` on `main[data-marketing-home]`

### Verify

```bash
pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run lint
pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run test -- test/home-*.spec.ts
pnpm run guard:marketing-home-hooks
```

**Forbidden:** new hooks · SDK · parallax JS · fake stats · urban CSS leak

