## PR-10 Immersive 3D hero (2026-07-04) — closed

**Goal:** Reference-style rotatable mountain spotlight in the Denali marketing hero — aligned with brand tokens (`#059669`, `#D97706`), no fake live weather or member counts.

### Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  subgraph RSC
    HomeHero["HomeHero (RSC)"]
    buildSpotlights["buildHomeHeroSpotlights()"]
  end
  subgraph Client
    StageClient["HomeHeroMountainStageClient (dynamic, ssr:false)"]
    Stage["HomeHeroMountainStage"]
    Canvas["HomeHeroMountainCanvas (R3F)"]
  end
  HomeHero --> buildSpotlights
  HomeHero --> StageClient
  StageClient --> Stage
  Stage --> Canvas
```

| Concern            | Decision                                                                                                                  |
| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Client boundary    | One `dynamic(..., { ssr: false })` wrapper; Three.js only in `@apps/marketing`                                            |
| Hooks              | Existing `data-marketing-home-*` preserved; additive `data-marketing-home-hero-immersive` + stage attrs (not smoke-gated) |
| Motion             | `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` → static destination image, no Canvas, orbit ring animation off                          |
| Stats panel        | Public geographic facts only (elevation, region) from i18n — **no** live temp/wind/visibility                             |
| Destination switch | Thumbnail picker; 360° prev/next nudge `OrbitControls`, not carousel index                                                |
| Default spotlight  | `damavand`                                                                                                                |
| LCP                | Loading shell `data-marketing-home-hero-stage-loading`; hero brand + CTAs render in RSC                                   |

### Files

| Layer             | Path                                                                     |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| RSC hero          | `apps/marketing/src/home/home-hero.tsx`                                  |
| Spotlight builder | `build-home-hero-spotlights.ts`, `home-hero-spotlight-types.ts`          |
| Client stage      | `home-hero-mountain-stage.tsx`, `home-hero-mountain-stage-client.tsx`    |
| R3F canvas        | `home-hero-mountain-canvas.tsx`                                          |
| CSS               | `denali-marketing.css` — immersive grid, glass stats, orbit ring, picker |
| i18n              | `home.full.hero.spotlight.*` fa/en                                       |
| deps              | `three`, `@react-three/fiber`, `@react-three/drei`                       |

### Verify

```bash
pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run lint
pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run test -- test/home-*.spec.ts
pnpm run guard:marketing-home-hooks
```

**Forbidden:** fake weather · member-count social proof · new smoke hooks · SDK changes

