## PR-12 Transparent landing header (2026-07-04) — active

**Goal:** Mobile-first glass header for full landing — floats over future fullscreen 3D hero.

| Element                         | Hook / behaviour                                                                                                                                |
| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Overlay mode                    | `data-marketing-header-overlay` on **home only** (`/` · `/en`) when `landing.variant === "full"` — middleware sets `x-marketing-header-overlay` |
| Brand                           | `data-marketing-brand` + logo or Mountain fallback                                                                                              |
| Primary nav (desktop ≥1024px)   | `data-marketing-header-nav` — Home, Tours, About, Contact                                                                                       |
| Actions                         | `data-marketing-header-actions` — locale, account (`data-marketing-portal-member`), CTA                                                         |
| Mobile drawer                   | `data-marketing-nav-drawer` — full nav + locale + CTA (smoke SMK-MKT-HOME-08)                                                                   |
| Catalog / detail / inner routes | Solid sticky header (`position: sticky`) — no overlay; content is not offset under fixed header                                                 |

**CSS token:** `--mkt-header-height: 4rem` — hero can offset under fixed overlay later.

**i18n:** `nav.home`, `nav.about`, `nav.contact`, `nav.primary`, `nav.signIn` (header portal entry — not «ثبت‌نام‌های من»; that stays footer-only)

### PR-12b Header UX audit (2026-07-04)

**ui-ux-pro-max:** Liquid Glass overlay · Lucide icons · 150ms hover · tab order = visual order · sticky offset via `--mkt-header-height`.

| Issue                      | Fix                                                                                  |
| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| «ثبت‌نام‌های من» in header | Marketing is anonymous → **`nav.signIn`** (ورود / Sign in); `memberArea` footer only |
| Grid 4 items / 3 cols      | `brand \| nav \| header-end` (toolbar + drawer)                                      |
| Nav priority               | Tours → About → Contact → Home (logo = home)                                         |
| Toolbar order (end)        | Locale → Sign in (icon) → CTA (amber, last = most prominent in RTL)                  |
| Mobile drawer              | Nav → CTA → locale → sign in text                                                    |

