## PR-15 Static cinematic hero (2026-07-04) — active

**Goal:** Ship premium landing hero without WebGL. Motion via CSS Ken Burns + optional pointer parallax (≤10px). 3D becomes a future pluggable module (`hero-3d`), not a release blocker.

### Architecture

```text
apps/marketing/src/home/
├── home-hero.tsx              # RSC — default production entry
├── hero-static/               # PR-15 static cinematic (default)
│   └── home-hero-static-parallax.tsx
└── hero-3d/                   # PR-10/14 R3F — isolated for future GLB pivot
    ├── home-hero-mountain-canvas.tsx
    ├── home-hero-mountain-stage.tsx
    ├── home-hero-mountain-stage-client.tsx
    ├── build-home-hero-spotlights.ts
    └── home-hero-spotlight-types.ts
```

### Hero DOM (hooks preserved)

| Layer         | Hook                                                                               |
| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Section       | `data-marketing-home-hero` + `data-marketing-home-hero-cinematic`                  |
| Background    | `img[data-marketing-home-hero-background]` — `--mkt-hero-image` fallback in CSS    |
| Overlays      | `data-marketing-home-hero-overlay-*` (vignette, bottom, atmosphere, headline glow) |
| Eyebrow       | `p[data-marketing-home-hero-eyebrow]`                                              |
| Copy stack    | `div[data-marketing-home-hero-copy]` — eyebrow + title + lead (PR-20O)             |
| Title / lead  | `h1[data-marketing-home-title]`, `p[data-marketing-home-lead]`                     |
| CTAs          | `a[data-marketing-home-cta]`, `a[data-marketing-home-cta-secondary]`               |
| Search        | `form[data-marketing-home-search]`                                                 |
| Scroll        | `span[data-marketing-home-hero-scroll-hint]`                                       |
| Parallax root | `div[data-marketing-home-hero-parallax-root]` — client boundary                    |

### Motion

| Concern        | Decision                                                       |
| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Ken Burns      | `scale(1)` → `scale(1.06)` over **26s** `ease-out` `alternate` |
| Parallax       | Desktop only; `--mkt-hero-parallax-x/y` max **10px**           |
| Reduced motion | No Ken Burns animation; no parallax                            |
| Mobile ≤639px  | Same image; no parallax; static background                     |
| LCP            | First slide `fetchPriority="high"` `loading="eager"`; later slides `low` / `lazy`. Native `img` (not `next/image` fill). |

### Removed from production path

- `HomeHeroMountainStageClient` import in `home-hero.tsx`
- `data-marketing-home-hero-immersive`
- WebGL resize / context-loss / R3F canvas shell

### CSS

PR-15 block in `denali-marketing.css` — full viewport (`100dvh − header`), gradient overlays, typography, CTA, responsive tablet/mobile.

### Verify

```bash
pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run lint
pnpm --filter @apps/marketing run test -- test/home-*.spec.ts
pnpm run guard:marketing-home-hooks
```

