| Hero client | `hero-static/home-hero-static-parallax.tsx` — scroll `--mkt-hero-scroll-shift` only (existing boundary)   |
| Docs        | This section                                                                                              |

### Hero motion (PR-15 + PR-16)

| Concern          | Decision                                                                     |
| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Ken Burns        | 32s alternate (PR-16); disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`               |
| Pointer parallax | Unchanged — ≤10px desktop (`--mkt-hero-parallax-x/y`)                        |
| Scroll parallax  | `--mkt-hero-scroll-shift` max **24px**; rAF-throttled scroll on hero section |
