| Content enter    | Existing `mkt-hero-enter` stagger preserved                                  |
| CTAs             | Primary + ghost hover lift; focus-visible rings unchanged                    |
| Search           | Glass `backdrop-filter` + solid fallback                                     |
| Scroll hint      | Refined chevron dot animation; hidden reduced-motion                         |

### Sections & shell

