| Latest overlap    | Negative `margin-block-start` under hero fade                                                       |
| Trust / final CTA | Gradient bands (PR-4/9 patterns)                                                                    |
| Footer            | Grid layout for `data-marketing-footer-*`                                                           |
| Scroll reveal     | `@supports (animation-timeline: view())` on post-hero sections; fallback one-shot `mkt-home-reveal` |
| Card hooks        | Destination / featured / latest cover rules restored for when section markup returns                |

