| Composition    | Header in interstitial band; editor picks separated below flagship                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| Continuity     | Transparent featured chapter; flagship image is Act II object                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| Spacing tokens | Guest theme defines `--space-1`…`6` and `--space-8` only; PR-20A synthesizes hero-bridge steps via `--mkt-act2-space-*`. **PR-mobile-gutter (2026-07-04):** shell block also defines `--space-10` / `--space-12` as `calc()` aliases — required because footer + section `padding: var(--space-10) …` is **invalid** when the var is missing (computed padding becomes `0`, footer appears flush to edges) |
| Specificity    | Featured padding uses `main > section[data-marketing-home-featured]:not([hidden]):not([aria-hidden=\"true\"])` so Act II `padding-block` wins over generic `main > section:not(...)` rhythm                                                                                                                                                                                                                |

**Forbidden:** Other sections · routing/gates · decorative-only pass.

